sevenance-by-joga (1.0-0ddebs6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/control : added missing libgl1 dependency, fixed spacing of
    the common-install-function-ddebs dependency, extended the
    description, 8k intro as listed on Pouet
  * debian/resources : added the real icon (was an empty file), made
    from the Pouet screenshot
  * debian/resources/sevenance-by-joga.desktop : added Keywords,
    Terminal and French entries
  * debian/rules : disabled dh_dwz and dh_shlibdeps (binary without
    section headers), like dh_strip and dh_makeshlibs
  * debian/sevenance-by-joga.lintian-overrides : statically-linked-
    binary false positive and pandoc groff-message
  * debian/sevenance-by-joga.6.md : fixed description, regenerated the
    manual page
  * debian/README.source : documented the unpacked executable

